      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bernard de Marigny co‑founded the Louisiana Race Course, which later became the famous Fair Grounds Race Course in New Orleans.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
